  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UP Police SI Syllabus / Exam Pattern 2025 </h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2025-08-12T23:50:16+05:30\">August 12, 2025</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:50 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Uttar Pradesh Police has released <strong data-end=\"131\" data-start=\"108\">4,543 new vacancies</strong> for <strong data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"136\">Sub Inspector (Civil Police)</strong>, <strong data-end=\"215\" data-start=\"170\">Sub Inspector (Civil Police \u2013 Women) (PC)</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"281\" data-start=\"221\">Sub Inspector/Platoon Commander (Special Security Force)</strong> positions. Cracking the SI exam demands a well-planned strategy, the right resources, and a thorough grasp of the <strong data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"396\">latest UP Police SI Syllabus and Exam Pattern 2025</strong>. A detailed understanding of the syllabus and exam pattern helps aspirants clearly identify the topics covered and the distribution of questions across each section of the exam.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;